            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Stereotactic radiosurgery is used for many indications. In functional neurosurgery, it is used to modulate the function of axons, neurons, and related brain circuits. In this article, indications, current techniques, and outcomes are discussed.</AbstractText>
